+//! Durable native Intent/Assignment control over the local Multi-Agent V2 runtime.
+//!
+//! OS sidecar locks serialize reload/validate/commit across controller instances.
+//! Reservations survive asynchronous execution; only observed turn termination
+//! releases ownership. Runtime authority is supplied by the native tool adapter,
+//! never inferred from requested capabilities or Root's config.
